                <mxCell id="c9001" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;b&gt;Not missing: 86 more dependency arrows are on the hidden layer &lt;i&gt;Background&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (View &amp;gt; Layers, tick it to show them in grey). They are left off the picture because they say nothing about the architecture:&lt;br&gt;• 83 into Domain Model classes: every group may use app/model ;&lt;br&gt;• 3 into the «utility» Formatter;&lt;br&gt;All 225 relationships are in this file and in class_diagram_v4.puml." vertex="1">
